   "he": "יוֹסֵף בֶּן חוֹנִי אוֹמֵר: הַנִּשְׁחָטִין כּוּ׳. אָמַר רַבִּי יוֹחָנָן: יוֹסֵף בֶּן חוֹנִי וְרַבִּי אֱלִיעֶזֶר, אָמְרוּ דָּבָר אֶחָד.",
   "en": "§ The mishna teaches: «Yosef ben Ḥoni says:» Other offerings «that are slaughtered» for the sake of a Paschal offering or a sin offering are unfit. «Rabbi Yoḥanan says: Yosef ben Ḥoni and Rabbi Eliezer said the same thing,» i.e., Rabbi Eliezer agrees with Yosef ben Ḥoni."
  }
